---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="DMCA Notice | F.MOVIES"
  description="Submit a copyright concern or DMCA notice to F.MOVIES."
  canonicalPath="/dmca"
>
  <section class="page-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-kicker">Copyright</span>
      <h1>DMCA notice</h1>
      <p>How to report a copyright concern related to F.MOVIES.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="dmca-content container">
    <p>F.MOVIES is a movie and TV-series discovery catalogue. We do not host, upload, store, or stream video files.</p>

    <h2>Copyright concerns</h2>
    <p>If you believe content available on this website infringes your copyright, email <a href="mailto:hello@f-movies.app?subject=DMCA%20notice">hello@f-movies.app</a> with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your full name and contact details.</li>
      <li>A clear identification of the copyrighted work.</li>
      <li>The exact F.MOVIES URL you are reporting.</li>
      <li>A statement that you have a good-faith belief the use is not authorised.</li>
      <li>A statement that the information in your notice is accurate, and that you are authorised to act for the copyright owner.</li>
      <li>Your electronic or physical signature.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What happens next</h2>
    <p>We review complete notices promptly. Where appropriate, we may remove or restrict the reported catalogue reference while we assess the request.</p>

    <h2>Counter notices</h2>
    <p>If you believe a catalogue reference was removed in error, contact us at the same address with your explanation and supporting information.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .dmca-content {
    max-width: 820px;
    padding-top: 56px;
    padding-bottom: 84px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .dmca-content > :first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  .dmca-content h2 {
    margin: 38px 0 10px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .dmca-content p { margin: 14px 0; }

  .dmca-content ul {
    margin: 14px 0;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }

  .dmca-content a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
